From 7d0c28e436407821315504518009c1cfeb0daa3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xie Hanlong <xiehanlong834@hust.edu.cn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 14:19:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: B134 event instrumentation + transfer phase timers
 (env-gated)

- 6-event contract chain (preempt/restore_start/restore_done/wakeup/admission/scheduled) to JSONL when B134_EVENTS_FILE is set (zero overhead otherwise)
- transfer phase timers: desc (packing/index), sync, submit, copy (wall-clock; event elapsed is unreliable on Ascend swap_blocks_batch)
- host-residency timers (cpu_store/cpu_evict), scheduler-step timer (sched_step)
---
